     A** Group CodeReveiw usage file - Indicates what CodeReview      *
     A** modules are to be used for a certain group                   *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  Created by: C:79    Project: 114MDC   Date: 04/24/02         *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  REVISIONS:                                                   *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PGX01                     TEXT('Group CodeReview usage file')
     A            GXCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('COMPANY#')
     A            GXSUB#    R               REFFLD(SUB#)
     A                                      COLHDG('SUBSCRIBER')
     A            GXFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A                                      COLHDG('GROUP')
     A            GXST      R               REFFLD(ST)
     A                                      COLHDG('FOR FUTURE USE')
     A            GXCRVW    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('CodeReview' 'module')
     A*                    Valid Values:
     A*                           Based on generic table id: CRVW
     A*
     A            GXEFDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Effective' 'Date')
     A            GXEXDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Expiration' 'Date')
     A            GXKBID    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('Knowledge' 'Base ID')
     A            GXSTAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            GXUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'User')
     A            GXPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Pgm')
     A            GXTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Time')
     A            GXDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Date')
     A            GXIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'User')
     A            GXIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'Pgm')
     A            GXITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'Time')
     A            GXIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'Date')
